# #233: the Sprite Sheet Slicer slices by Cell Size - the cell size typed
# (whole pixels), as many cells as fit; the preset and the animations made
# keep it ("cell_size").
wait 5
key escape
click @menu:Tools
click @menu:Tools/Sprite Sheet Slicer...
click @slicer.texture
click @pick:textures/Asteroid_2.png
dblclick @slicer.cols
key ctrl+a
type 4
key enter
click @slicer.mode
click @pick:Cell Size
wait 2
screenshot by_cell_size
click @slicer.save-preset
wait 2
expect file:textures/Asteroid_2.png.import.json contains "cell_size"
click @slicer.cell:0
click @slicer.name
type spin
click @slicer.add
click @slicer.create
wait 2
click @toolbar.save
wait 2
expect file:scenes/main.scene.json contains "cell_size"
